ex02_DW___ Example 2: 1 keV D on W at normal incidence (dynamic, fluence 10 atoms/A^2), D is H with mass 2.014
# obligatory control parameters
cdat 0 10.0 1
geom 500.0 100 0.0
atda H W
comp 0.0 1.0
irra 1 1000.0 0.0 1.0
# optional control parameters
thrd 1
pspr 20000
coll 1 0
damg 0.0
mass 1 2.0141
elst 3
exst 1 0.5 3 0
fout 100 100 20
outp
outi spyl srfc srfe reem
outl incd rang scat rrlv
